 "name": "Distract",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/ce.svg",
 "folder": null,
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>If you take the Distract action, you can attempt to Distract a creature within 15 ft of you that can see or hear you. If they are concentrating on a technique or ability, they are forced to make a concentration check to maintain the ability. Even if they succeed, your distraction increases the DC of concentration checks they make by +1 until the beginning of your turn, so long as you remain within 15 feet and continue distracting. A single creature can only be affected by up to 3 DC increases as a result of creatures using this action.</p>"
  },
